I was playing a priest and having a pretty good game. I had over 50
hit points and some pretty nice items while still on dlvl 4. I had
recently plundered a shop and was experimenting with throwing gems to
several unicorns on the level, when I got the weird message "you hear
the howling of the CwnAnnwn..." or something of the sort. Around this
time, I started spontaneously losing hit points with no monsters near
(my maximum number was decreasing by one every few moves). I rapidly
went from a rather powerful character to where I had just one hit
point left, and one hit point maximum! Needless to say, I didn't last
very long after, and in the score list, it said I died "while already
on Charon's boat". Now my question is what happened and why? If Charon
rows the boat across to hell, it seems like I shouldn't encounter
anything like this until I meet the Wiz. There is a fortune cookie
saying: "Row (3x) that boat gently down the stream, Charon (4x), death
is but a dream." but that doesn't help much.

